# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# What is EXCLUDED and why
#
# Only two things are excluded, and both are bulk data that the notebook
# regenerates automatically — everything else (all 27 model checkpoints,
# every result file, every notebook version) IS committed on purpose, so
# the full trail of the work is visible.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# The downloaded BigEarthNet subset (~2.4 GB) — fetched by notebook §2 in one line
data/BENv2_lithuania_summer/

# Preprocessed memory-mapped arrays (~3.4 GB) — rebuilt by notebook §4 from the above
data/processed/*.npy

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
